# Animation and Movement

## Reference
- `docs/ANIMATION-AND-MOVEMENT-GUIDE.md`
- `docs/ANIMATION-GLOSSARY.md`

## Mixamo FBX
- Same rig as `RunningboyRig.fbx`
- "Without Skin"; FBX Binary format
- In-place clips (no root motion)

## Turn / Bones
- Turn clips animate `BonesCharacter.quaternion`
- `model.rotation.y` set separately (body facing)
- `getBonesCharacterYawDeg`, `resetBonesCharacter`

## Sequences
- `playSequence([steps])` — steps: animation, walkTo, pause
- `walkTo(target)` — turn → start-walking → walking → stop-walking
- `playTurnToFace(direction)`

## Trapezoid Bounds
- `trapezoidBounds.ts` — frustum-derived walk limits in XZ
- Math is framework-agnostic (Vector3)

## Turn Strategies (URL)
- `?turn=lerp` (default) — gradual model.rotation.y
- `?turn=snap` — instant 90° pre-offset
- `?turn=reset` — clear BonesCharacter after turn
